My R Script has the following form (is applied on a small dataset cars.csv):

I am trying to compute the mean value based on my key.

rm(list=ls(all=TRUE))

Sys.setenv(HADOOP_HOME="/opt/mapr/hadoop/hadoop-0.20.2/")
